{"document":{"type":"root","children":[{"type":"code","value":"type UndefinedInitialQueryOptionsWithDataTag<TQueryFnData, TError, TData, TQueryKey> = QueryOptions<TQueryFnData, TError, TData, TQueryFnData, TQueryKey> & WithUndefinedInitialData<TQueryFnData> & QueryKeyWithDataTag<TQueryKey, TQueryFnData, TError>;","lang":"ts"},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Defined in: "},{"type":"link","href":"https://github.com/TanStack/query/blob/main/packages/vue-query/src/queryOptions.ts#L199","children":[{"type":"text","value":"packages/vue-query/src/queryOptions.ts:199"}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"The options returned by the "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"queryOptions"},{"type":"text","value":" overload selected when "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"initialData"},{"type":"text","value":" is omitted or may be\n"},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"undefined"},{"type":"text","value":", with the "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"queryKey"},{"type":"text","value":" tagged with the query's data and error types."}]},{"type":"heading","depth":2,"id":"type-parameters","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Type Parameters"}]},{"type":"heading","depth":3,"id":"tqueryfndata","children":[{"type":"text","value":"TQueryFnData"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"TQueryFnData"},{"type":"text","value":" = "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"unknown"}]},{"type":"heading","depth":3,"id":"terror","children":[{"type":"text","value":"TError"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"TError"},{"type":"text","value":" = "},{"type":"link","href":"DefaultError.md","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"DefaultError"}]}]},{"type":"heading","depth":3,"id":"tdata","children":[{"type":"text","value":"TData"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"TData"},{"type":"text","value":" = "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"TQueryFnData"}]},{"type":"heading","depth":3,"id":"tquerykey","children":[{"type":"text","value":"TQueryKey"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"TQueryKey"},{"type":"text","value":" "},{"type":"emphasis","children":[{"type":"text","value":"extends"}]},{"type":"text","value":" "},{"type":"link","href":"QueryKey.md","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"QueryKey"}]},{"type":"text","value":" = "},{"type":"link","href":"QueryKey.md","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"QueryKey"}]}]}],"headings":[{"id":"type-parameters","text":"Type Parameters","level":2},{"id":"tqueryfndata","text":"TQueryFnData","level":3},{"id":"terror","text":"TError","level":3},{"id":"tdata","text":"TData","level":3},{"id":"tquerykey","text":"TQueryKey","level":3}]},"frameworks":[],"downloadMarkdown":"\n```ts\ntype UndefinedInitialQueryOptionsWithDataTag<TQueryFnData, TError, TData, TQueryKey> = QueryOptions<TQueryFnData, TError, TData, TQueryFnData, TQueryKey> & WithUndefinedInitialData<TQueryFnData> & QueryKeyWithDataTag<TQueryKey, TQueryFnData, TError>;\n```\n\nDefined in: [packages/vue-query/src/queryOptions.ts:199](https://github.com/TanStack/query/blob/main/packages/vue-query/src/queryOptions.ts#L199)\n\nThe options returned by the `queryOptions` overload selected when `initialData` is omitted or may be\n`undefined`, with the `queryKey` tagged with the query's data and error types.\n\n## Type Parameters\n\n### TQueryFnData\n\n`TQueryFnData` = `unknown`\n\n### TError\n\n`TError` = [`DefaultError`](DefaultError.md)\n\n### TData\n\n`TData` = `TQueryFnData`\n\n### TQueryKey\n\n`TQueryKey` *extends* [`QueryKey`](QueryKey.md) = [`QueryKey`](QueryKey.md)\n","originalRawMarkdown":"---\nid: UndefinedInitialQueryOptionsWithDataTag\ntitle: UndefinedInitialQueryOptionsWithDataTag\n---\n\n```ts\ntype UndefinedInitialQueryOptionsWithDataTag<TQueryFnData, TError, TData, TQueryKey> = QueryOptions<TQueryFnData, TError, TData, TQueryFnData, TQueryKey> & WithUndefinedInitialData<TQueryFnData> & QueryKeyWithDataTag<TQueryKey, TQueryFnData, TError>;\n```\n\nDefined in: [packages/vue-query/src/queryOptions.ts:199](https://github.com/TanStack/query/blob/main/packages/vue-query/src/queryOptions.ts#L199)\n\nThe options returned by the `queryOptions` overload selected when `initialData` is omitted or may be\n`undefined`, with the `queryKey` tagged with the query's data and error types.\n\n## Type Parameters\n\n### TQueryFnData\n\n`TQueryFnData` = `unknown`\n\n### TError\n\n`TError` = [`DefaultError`](DefaultError.md)\n\n### TData\n\n`TData` = `TQueryFnData`\n\n### TQueryKey\n\n`TQueryKey` *extends* [`QueryKey`](QueryKey.md) = [`QueryKey`](QueryKey.md)\n"}
